# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:173
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_2dbdb956:

    # "The man in black blocked my path, blades ready."
    "검은 옷의 남자가 칼날을 준비한 채 내 길을 막아섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:174
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_92f5db33:

    # MC "(I have to try, I just need to get past!)"
    MC "(해봐야 해, 그냥 지나가기만 하면 돼!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:175
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_05ee5938:

    # "I darted onto the side wall, springing off from my foot to bounce off as I twisted my whole body and swung my tail to try and knock the man back."
    "옆 벽으로 날아가 발을 디디고 튕겨 나와 온몸을 틀며 꼬리를 휘둘러 남자를 뒤로 밀쳐내려 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:176
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_6a1754bb:

    # "It grabbed onto my tail as I slammed it against the wall, sending shards of stone flying."
    "내가 그것을 벽에 내리쳐 돌조각들이 날아가게 할 때, 그것은 내 꼬리를 붙잡았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:177
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_d7df702e:

    # "The man in black refused to give up, forcing blades through my tail."
    "검은 옷의 남자는 포기하지 않고, 칼날을 내 꼬리에 박아 넣었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:178
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_20d8f036:

    # "I screeched out in pain but the man in black kept coming no matter what I did."
    "고통에 비명을 질렀지만, 검은 옷의 남자는 내가 무엇을 하든 계속 다가왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:179
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_cb953dbd:

    # "Only now did I realize how close death was..."
    "이제서야 죽음이 얼마나 가까이 와있는지 깨달았다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:180
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_0e939507:

    # UNKNOWN "{i}*Whistles*{/i}"
    UNKNOWN "{i}*휘파람*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:182
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_9afc807c:

    # "As the man in black turned sharply towards the sound, he was suddenly blasted back by a bolt of lightning."
    "검은 옷의 남자가 소리 쪽으로 급히 돌아서자, 그는 갑자기 번개의 일격에 뒤로 날아갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:183
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_13c9ce29:

    # "Beside Captain Nyx, four mages stood at the ready, their staffs pointed towards the convulsing automaton."
    "닉스 대장 옆에는, 네 명의 마법사가 준비 태세로 서 있었고, 그들의 지팡이는 경련하는 오토마톤을 향해 겨누어져 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:211
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_98ef091a:

    # "It struggled and rose to its feet again, charging towards the Captain and the mages."
    "그것은 몸부림치며 다시 일어나, 대위와 마법사들을 향해 돌진했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:218
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_9304bfda:

    # "...But another blast sent him wheeling backwards."
    "...하지만 또 다른 폭발이 그를 뒤로 휘청이게 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:220
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_18e5bb6b:

    # "Clambering back to its feet before they could finish it off, the man in black charged forward, dodging the third blast right through the Captain and her mages, scurrying its way up the stairs."
    "그들이 끝장내기 전에 다시 일어선 검은 옷의 남자는 돌진했다. 세 번째 폭발을 피해 대장과 마법사들 사이를 뚫고 재빨리 계단을 올라갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:221
translate kr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_53131c31:

    # NYX @ angry "AFTER HIM!"
    NYX @ angry "쫓아라!"

